#: ui/migrate.ui:386
msgid ""
"Tunnel migration through the libvirtd connection channel, rather than having "
"the hypervisor open a separate network connection to the destination. The "
"source libvirt instance connects directly to the destination libvirt "
"instance.\n"
"\n"
"This can simplify setup since no additional firewall ports need to be open, "
"and will encrypt migration traffic if your libvirt connection is encrypted. "
"But it can be difficult to make this work with SSH transport."
msgstr ""
"Tunelēt migrāciju caur libvirtd savienojuma kanālu, nevis ļaut hipervizoram "
"atvērt atsevišķu tīkla savienojumu ar mērķi. Avota libvirt instance "
"savienojas tieši ar mērķa libvirt instanci.\n"
"\n"
"Tas var vienkāršot iestatīšanu, jo nav jāatver papildu ugunsmūra porti, un "
"šifrēs migrācijas datplūsmu, ja jūsu libvirt savienojums ir šifrēts. Taču to "
"var būt grūti panākt ar SSH transportu."

#: ui/migrate.ui:474
msgid "_URI:"
msgstr "_URI:"

#: ui/migrate.ui:509
msgid "<b>Connectivity</b>"
msgstr "<b>Savienojamība</b>"

#: ui/migrate.ui:537
msgid ""
"By default libvirt will refuse to migrate a VM for certain configurations "
"that could lead to malfunctioning guests, like if a disk's cache mode is not "
"'none'.\n"
"\n"
"Enabling this option tells libvirt to skip those checks."
msgstr ""
"Pēc noklusējuma libvirt atteiksies migrēt VM noteiktās konfigurācijās, kas "
"var izraisīt viesu nepareizu darbību, piemēram, ja diska kešatmiņas režīms "
"nav 'none'.\n"
"\n"
